data: {"id": "6595efe8e7f74948-thinking-parallel_evidence-2029", "run_id": "6595efe8e7f74948", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod 生命周期与状态（kubectl_describe + YAML）\n- **当前状态**：Pod phase=Running，但 `Ready=False`，containersNotReady。\n- **容器 app 状态**：Waiting/CrashLoopBackOff，Exit Code=137，重启 25 次，BackOff 5 分钟（事件计数 489 次/105 分钟，说明已持续崩溃约 105 分钟）。\n- **Last State**：Terminated，Reason=`OOMKilled`，Exit Code=137。\n- **时间线**：Last State 的 Started=`11:09:47`，Finished=`11:09:48`——仅存活 1 秒即被 OOM Killed。\n\n### 2. 容器启动命令与资源配置（YAML）\n- **镜像**：`xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`\n- **Command**：`python3 -u -c \"imp", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789384341322, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

